// Cyberpunk add-on skins: motion + 3D art (wave 2). Generated by the art crew, not hand-edited.
// Fan homage; our own pixel art. Fight frames: pose sheets of our existing sprites, cut to the cast.ts format.
// Turnarounds: low-poly toon models rendered headless in Blender (8 views), nearest-neighbour shrink, <= 8 colours.
// Layers (skyline, rain, crowd, cones): drawn in code. Every figure faces RIGHT; mirror in the scene when needed.
// Prefixes: CP77_ (Cyberpunk 2077), ARA_ (Arasaka), LUCY_ (Lucy), SAM_ (SAMURAI), ER2_ (Edgerunners 2, D), CAPRI_ (CAPRICORN).
// Sizes, beats and pivots: manifest.json next to this file. PG-13: impacts and glitch-outs only.

